{%-liquid
  assign image = item.product.featured_image
  if item.image
    assign image = item.image
  endif

  comment
    Thumbnails follow the product card's ratio setting, resolved through the same util
    as everywhere else. The number is what the image snippet crops the srcset to; the
    box itself (ratio, radius, matte) comes from util-card-media, so a line item and a
    card can't end up looking like two different components.
  endcomment
  capture card_aspect
    render 'util-aspect-ratio', ratio: settings.card_aspect_ratio
  endcapture
  assign card_aspect = card_aspect | strip

  comment
    Defaulted, not passed straight through: the setting reads as nil until the theme is
    saved once, and a blank `layout` drops the image out of its box entirely.
  endcomment
  assign card_layout = settings.card_image_layout | default: 'cover'
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  @param {object} item
  @param {boolean} [qty]     - false renders a Remove link instead of the quantity stepper
  @param {boolean} [compact] - drop both, for read-only contexts like the mini cart

  data-line-key is the line item key, so a specific line can be picked out of freshly
  rendered section markup.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div id="cartLineItem" data-line-key="{{ item.key }}" class="flex gap-x-gutter">
  <div class="w-24">
    <div {% render 'util-card-media', extra_class: 'w-full relative', ratio: card_aspect %}>
      {%- comment -%} sizes: the thumbnail column is w-24, i.e. 96px; srcset covers the DPR. {%- endcomment -%}
      {% render 'image',
        src: image,
        layout: card_layout,
        loading: 'eager',
        ratio: card_aspect,
        sizes: '96px',
        width: 100
      %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="cartUpdate" class="grow basis-0 col-span-4 flex flex-col">
    <div class="flex justify-between grow gap-x-gutter">
      <a href="{{ item.url }}">
        {{ item.product.title }}
        <div class="body-small">
          {{ item.variant.title }}
          {%- for property in item.properties -%}
            <span class="block text-light-text-color">{{ property[0] }}: {{ property[1] }}
            </span>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      </a>
      <div class="shrink-0">
        <div>
          {% render 'product-price',
            item: item.variant,
            times: item.quantity
          %}
        </div>
        {% if qty == false and compact != true %}
          <cart-remove-item>
            <button class="cart-remove-item body-small hover:!text-error !h-auto button transparent unpadd" data-item-id="{{ item.id }}">Remove</button>
          </cart-remove-item>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% if qty != false and compact != true %}
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
        <div>
          {% render 'cart-item-quantity-adjust', item: item %}
        </div>
        <cart-remove-item>
          <button class="cart-remove-item body-small hover:!text-error !h-auto button transparent unpadd" data-item-id="{{ item.id }}">Remove</button>
        </cart-remove-item>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>
